+/* Stitch round 6 — tour showcase, package builder, route simulator, host portal. Tokens: plum #2A1530, coral #EF5B3D/#ad2c12, cream #F5EEE4, paper #FFFAF4, line #E7DCD4, muted #7F6D79. */
